# Phase 14a (#64, docs/phase14a-brief.md 7 A2): Settings > About: the Videos count and the capacity legend
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui-video scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p14a-about.script
# (ipodui-p14a-* default to build/sim-ui-video; the gate runs them there)
# needs: video
#
# Disk: tests/fixtures/videos/mkvideos.sh (installed by the gate's prime
# step, or by shots.sh for a standalone run):
#   Movies/        Audio First  High Profile  Late Chapter  Short Film
#   TV Shows/      Show A (S1 x2, S2 x2, tagged)  Show B (S1 x2, untagged)
#   Misc/          Show.C.S01E02.m4v  S01E03.m4v (nameless)
#   Podcasts/Pod One/  Audio Episode.m4a  Video Episode.m4v
#   Music/         Fixture Singer/Audio Only.mp4 (a song)
#                  Fixture Author/Image Book.m4b (a book)
# Main menu with Videos on (T1 default): Music, Videos, Podcasts, Extras,
# Settings, Shuffle Songs. Videos: Movies, TV Shows, Settings.

# 12 videos in the fixtures: 4 movies + 8 TV episodes (video podcasts count
# under Podcasts only, owner T5); the Video segment of the capacity capsule
# is every video file's size, the podcast episode included.
# log: about page=1 songs=6 episodes=2
# logrange: 4096 16384 about videos=12 video_kib=(\d+)
wait 4000
wait_db 45000
wheel +4 300        # Settings (Music, Videos, Podcasts, Extras, Settings)
wait 600
key SELECT
wait 900
key SELECT          # About
wait 1500
shot page1          # capsule: Audio / Video / Other, legend
key RIGHT
wait 700
shot page2          # Songs, Videos 12, Podcasts 2 ...
key MENU
wait 700
